# exploration.route's keys for the compact text, which closes three of its ten dialogues in fewer boxes: each of
# those dialogues' keys kept up to the press the compact text closes it on, the directions the recording held when
# the game's own layout closed it set at that frame, and every later key moved as many frames earlier (108 in all).
# The same 78 rooms as the recording, each entered as many frames sooner as the dialogues before it saved, on SameBoy
# and mGBA.
